<title>POLAND: BPH plans over 20 pct 1996 payout.</title>
<headline>BPH plans over 20 pct 1996 payout.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Poland's Bank Przemyslowo- Handlowy SA (BPH) plans to earmark more than 20 percent of its 1996 net profit for dividend, the president of the bank said on Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;The management will propose to share out over 20 percent of (1996) profit,&quot; Henryka Pieronkiewicz told reporters.  </p>
<p>-- Malgorzata Rzepka +48 22 653 9700i</p>
